{"slug":"North_America","title":"North America","section":"Maps","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2},{"id":"See_more","text":"See more","level":1}],"html":"<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-North_America_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"155\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"362\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Height_Map\" title=\"Height Map\">Height map</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/Maps\">Map</a> of Northern and Central America and Greenland.</p>\n<p>Mostly hilly and mountainous <a href=\"/Terrain\">terrain</a> with some plains mostly near oceans and in the northern and eastern parts of the <a href=\"/Maps\">map</a>. There are a lot of water and rivers.</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/North_America_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"331\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2800\" data-file-height=\"1448\"><figcaption>The North America map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/northamerica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2>\n<p>The map features 71 named <a href=\"/Nations\">nations</a>, including Florida, Mexico, Guatemala, Honduras, Nicaragua and Panama.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Categories:</strong> Featured, Continental, North America</li>\n<li><strong>Nations:</strong> 71</li>\n<li><strong>Public rotation frequency:</strong> 5</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\">map</a> is 2800 x 1448.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></p>\n<h1 id=\"See_more\">See more</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/Maps\">Maps</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>"}
